  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ring_Of_Attraction/BH_ROA_HEADER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"288\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#800000\"><strong>這是一個簡單的模組，包含一個物品：吸引力戒指。&nbsp; 當此物品位於玩家的背包中時，它會將物品拉向玩家以進行自動拾取。</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/clients/aff.php?aff=3271\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ring_Of_Attraction/BH_ROA_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"280\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ring_Of_Attraction/BH_ROA_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">使用方法：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 右鍵點擊 開啟/關閉戒指</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這是《Gobber 2》模組中「吸引力戒指」的獨立版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">合成配方：</span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/288/336/screen-shot-2020-04-23-at-6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"370\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/j7bYbkW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ring_Of_Attraction/BH_ROA_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"></strong></a></p>",
